  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Soft to the touch and effortlessly chic, the Gemini Suede Convertible Wristlet brings a luxe, tactile twist to your everyday carry. Its velvety finish adds depth to even the simplest outfit, while the convertible design keeps things flexible. A wristlet that feels as good as it looks.</p>\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin-top: 1.5rem;\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\">Specifications & Details</h4>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6;\">\n<li><strong>Material:</strong> Suede</li>\n<li><strong>Hardware:</strong> Gold hardware</li>\n<li><strong>Shoulder Strap Drop:</strong> Convertible shoulder strap with 7.5&quot; drop</li>\n<li><strong>Pockets:</strong> 3 interior credit card slots</li>\n<li><strong>Closure:</strong> Zip closure</li>\n<li><strong>Bag Dimensions:</strong> 8.4&quot; (L) x 4.4&quot; (H) x 1.6&quot; (W)</li>\n</ul>\n</div>",
